  "text": "proprium.cathedra-sancti-petri-secreta",
  "about": "The secreta of the formulary “Chair of Saint Peter the Apostle” in the 1962 Roman Missal.",
  "segments": {
    "s01": { "translation": "We beseech You, O Lord, may the prayer of the blessed Apostle, Peter, recommend the petitions and offerings of Your Church, so that what we celebrate in his honor may obtain forgiveness for us. Through our Lord Jesus Christ, Thy Son, who liveth and reigneth with Thee in the unity of the Holy Ghost, God, world without end. Amen." }
